  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supervision of works for improving the accessibility to public buildings</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This supervisision contract is designed to supervise 3 works contracts for improvement of access for persons with disability and reduced mobility to various public buildings in the Republic of Serbia like: healthcare centres, municipal buildings, cultural and social work centres, public schools, post office, libraries etc. The scope of works will include construction of elevators, installation of stair lifts, staircase platforms, access ramps, etc.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
